<v Susan Zalkind>是的。能听到吗？

00:25:21.750 --> 00:25:23.070
<v Ashur Miraliev>Yes.
<v Ashur Miraliev>可以。

00:25:23.070 --> 00:25:37.940
<v Susan Zalkind>We talked over an internet phone line. Ashur moved to Florida in 2011 on a student visa. He started hanging out with a crew of Russian speakers, and that's how he met Ibragim. Ashur is only 20 years old, so he was nearly eight years younger than Ibragim.
<v Susan Zalkind>我们通过网络电话进行了交流。阿舒尔2011年持学生签证搬到佛罗里达。他开始和一群讲俄语的人混在一起，这就是他结识易卜拉欣的方式。阿舒尔只有20岁，所以他比易卜拉欣小了近八岁。

00:25:37.940 --> 00:25:48.360
<v Susan Zalkind>He said they had a good friendship, but because of the age difference, it wasn't super close. Ibragim didn't confide in him. He said Ibragim was more like a brother than a friend.
