<v Ashur Miraliev>They told me that, like, let's go to the office, you know, there's air conditioning, blah, blah, blah. We can chill and talk, you know?
<v Ashur Miraliev>他们告诉我，比如，去办公室吧，你知道，那里有空调，等等等等。我们可以坐下来聊聊，你知道？

