<v Susan Zalkind>Ashur was driven to a police station where they entered this in their system as merely a traffic stop, no other information. But according to documents from the County Sheriff's department, Ashur was soon headed over to the FBI, where he says agents aggressively questioned him about his relationship with Ibragim. They were convinced that he'd been one of Ibragim's closest friends, that he had to know something.
<v Susan Zalkind>阿舒尔被带到一个警察局，他们将其系统里登记为一次普通的交通拦截，没有其他信息。但根据县治安官部门的文件，阿舒尔很快被转送到了FBI，他说探员们咄咄逼人地审问了他与易卜拉欣的关系。他们确信他曾是易卜拉欣最亲近的朋友之一，他肯定知道些什么。

00:28:24.660 --> 00:28:29.720
<v Susan Zalkind>What kind of information about Ibragim were they interested in?
<v Susan Zalkind>他们对关于易卜拉欣的什么信息感兴趣？

