<v Ashur Miraliev>Like, what kind of relationship he had with Tsarnaevs, when he was in the Boston. Do you know his Boston friends? Do you know who was with him at the time of triple murder, you know?
<v Ashur Miraliev>比如，他和萨纳耶夫兄弟是什么关系，他在波士顿的时候。你认识他波士顿的朋友吗？你知道三尸命案发生时谁和他在一起吗，你知道？

00:28:53.860 --> 00:29:02.450
<v Ashur Miraliev>What do I know about triple murder? What did Ibragim told me about triple murder, you know? Like, these kids of questions.
<v Ashur Miraliev>我关于三尸命案知道什么？易卜拉欣关于三尸命案告诉过我什么，你知道？就是这些问题。

00:29:02.450 --> 00:29:19.720
<v Susan Zalkind>It surprised me that they were asking Ashur about the Waltham murders four months after Ibragim had been killed, four months after Ibragim had supposedly confessed. Ashur told me he knew nothing about the triple murder. He'd never met the Tsarnaevs. He's never even been to Boston.
<v Susan Zalkind>易卜拉欣被杀四个月后，FBI还在问阿舒尔关于沃尔瑟姆谋杀案的事，这让我很惊讶，毕竟四个多月前易卜拉欣就已经“供认”了。阿舒尔告诉我他对比三尸命案一无所知。他从未见过萨纳耶夫兄弟。他甚至从未去过波士顿。

